<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Desmond on Typophile Archive</title><link>http://typophile-archive.simon-cozens.org/tags/desmond/</link><description>Recent content in Desmond on Typophile Archive</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>en-us</language><lastBuildDate>Thu, 25 Feb 2010 06:45:00 +0100</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="http://typophile-archive.simon-cozens.org/tags/desmond/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Audebaud Released</title><link>http://typophile-archive.simon-cozens.org/67807/</link><pubDate>Thu, 25 Feb 2010 06:45:00 +0100</pubDate><guid>http://typophile-archive.simon-cozens.org/67807/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="http://web.archive.org/web/20140714072213im_/http:/typophile.com/files/audebaud_00_6547.png" alt=""&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="http://web.archive.org/web/20140714072213im_/http:/typophile.com/files/audebaud_02_5444.png" alt=""&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="http://web.archive.org/web/20140714072213im_/http:/typophile.com/files/audebaud_01_5020.png" alt=""&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Now available for purchase via &lt;a href="http://web.archive.org/web/20140714072213/http:/www.youworkforthem.com/product.php?sku=T0494"&gt;YWFT&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href="http://web.archive.org/web/20140714072213/http:/new.myfonts.com/fonts/madtype/audebaud/"&gt;MyFonts.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Check out &lt;a href="http://web.archive.org/web/20140714072213/http:/www.madtype.com/"&gt;MADType&lt;/a&gt; for more info.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Audebaud is the first release that contains my new multi-language character set. It covers more languages than Adobe Latin 3.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;I am also in the process of updating all of my previously released fonts with various types of fixes. They will all be OpenType, some with more features than others. You should see them up soon.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>